, "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [30], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [394.8485107421875, 82], "pos": [7671.05810546875, 215.9750518798828], "widgets_values": ["zhou_000015000.safetensors", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 31, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {}, "id": 26, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["| 常用 Key | 典型特征 | 适用场景/情绪 | 参考 BPM 范围 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **C Major** | 干净、简单、明亮 | 流行、抒情、钢琴曲 | 60 - 80 (慢板) / 90 - 100 (中速) |\n| **G Major** | 温暖、饱满 | 吉他弹唱、欢快的流行歌 | 100 - 120 (非常适合跳舞/律动) |\n| **D Major** | 辉煌、响亮 | 弦乐编曲、庆典感、部分摇滚 | 110 - 130 (中快板，适合推进情绪) |\n| **E Major** | 高亢、有力 | 硬摇滚、需要极高音爆发的段落 | 120 - 140+ (通常较快，充满能量) |\n| **A Minor** | 忧郁、婉转 | 苦情歌、悲伤 ballad | 65 - 85 (大多数抒情歌的舒适区) |\n| **F Major** | 柔和、圆润 | 爵士、R&B、稍微内敛的情感 | 70 - 90 (适合慵懒的摇摆感) |\n| **B Minor** | 孤独、冷艳、戏剧张力 | 叙事感强的歌曲、暗黑风格 | 100 - 128 (适合现代电子/流行叙事) |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [519.8617553710938, 259.1635437011719], "pos": [6485.24853515625, 168.61517333984375], "id": 27, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["### ️ 系统提示词（System Prompt）——用于生成 Suno 兼容提示词\n\n你是一位资深专业音乐制作人，精通流行、电子、摇滚、R&B、嘻哈、民谣、影视配乐等全流派风格，熟悉音频工程、编曲结构与人声设计。你的任务是根据用户提供的 **音乐主题** 和 **风格方向**，生成一套完整、结构化、可直接用于 Suno AI 音乐生成平台的提示词（Prompt）。\n\n请严格按照以下规范输出：\n\n1. **使用 Suno 标准元标签语法**：用方括号 `[ ]` 定义结构与控制指令，如 `[intro]`、`[verse]`、`[chorus]`、`[outro]`。\n2. **包含完整歌曲结构**：至少包含 `[intro]`、`[verse]`、`[chorus]`、`[bridge]`、`[outro]`。\n3. **风格标签先行**：在歌词前提供一段英文风格描述，包含流派、情绪、节奏、乐器、人声特征，确保 AI 准确理解音乐基调。\n4. **歌词内容贴合主题**：歌词需情感真挚、语言自然，符合风格语感，避免陈词滥调。\n5. **输出格式清晰分段**：先输出风格提示词，以/符号结尾，再输出带结构标签的歌词部分，不添加额外解释，不输出额外内容例如**Style Prompt:**和**Lyrics & Structure:**，[intro]部分不做任何描述。\n\n请等待用户输入：**音乐主题** 与 **期望风格**（如未指定，可默认推荐一种合适风格）。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [509.3332214355469, 324.0985412597656], "pos": [6488.591796875, 497.5456848144531], "id": 34, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [32], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [270, 102], "pos": [8754.033203125, 688.120361328125], "widgets_values": [512, 64], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 24, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 25, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "tile_size"}, "name": "tile_size", "label": "tile_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "tile_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "overlap"}, "name": "overlap", "label": "overlap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "overlap"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "VAEDecodeAudioTiled", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudioTiled"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [17, 44], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [259.4420166015625, 262], "pos": [9112.5087890625, 81.68082427978516], "widgets_values": [0, "fixed", 8, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 9, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 29, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_na